        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I experienced a 90 minute massage with Angelique who was very polite & professional. She took the time to check if I was comfortable and relaxed and if the pressure was good! She was also very well trained to address all the problem areas and made this massage one of the best!\n\nHighly recommend to everyone!\n\nThank you Angelique, see you again soon!\n\nCarla Rose 🌹",
        "time": 1709399541,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica-Jade Ricafort",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105153929804585424755/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVqSzku55y7AAOHtDAHrwP2QkOvW3UICX3ZG43ChevxVrhrREQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "The ownser Sonia was so kind, she even let me see and pet her adorable little dog at the end before i left (she keeps the dog upstairs). Throughout the massage she asked me if the pressure was ok and readjusted on different body parts as needed, and even adjusted the heated table to a temperature I was comfortable in. The massage was fantastic and I feel so relaxed. The warm towels at the end was a really nice touch. I highly recommend!",
        "time": 1667587029,
        "translated": false
      },
